{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeH4AlgebraLaws","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeH4AlgebraLaws","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeH4StabilizationRung","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":57,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.instAlgebra","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.instAlgebra","kind":"instance","line":401,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L401-L406","doc":"**The H₄(q) NF module is an `R`-algebra** — scalar action compatible\nwith `mulNF₄` on both sides (the proved homogeneity laws). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.instRing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.instRing","kind":"instance","line":386,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L386-L399","doc":"**The H₄(q) NF module is a `Ring`** — multiplication `mulNF₄`, unit γ,\nall laws discharged by the theorems above (associativity via the structured\ngenerator-commutation route). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.one_v","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.one_v","kind":"theorem","line":384,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L384-L384","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.mul_v","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.mul_v","kind":"theorem","line":383,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L383-L383","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.instOne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.instOne","kind":"instance","line":380,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L380-L381","doc":"One: the NF unit γ. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.instMul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.instMul","kind":"instance","line":377,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L377-L378","doc":"Multiplication: the proved NF product `mulNF₄`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.instModule","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.instModule","kind":"instance","line":373,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L373-L375","doc":"R-module structure, transported along the coordinates. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.vHom","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.vHom","kind":"def","line":369,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L369-L371","doc":"The additive-group hom onto NF coordinates (transport vehicle). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.instAddCommGroup","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.instAddCommGroup","kind":"instance","line":364,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L364-L367","doc":"Additive group, transported along the coordinates. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.v_injective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.v_injective","kind":"theorem","line":360,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L360-L362","doc":"Coordinate projection is injective (transport vehicle). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.smul_v","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.smul_v","kind":"theorem","line":358,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L358-L358","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.neg_v","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.neg_v","kind":"theorem","line":357,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L357-L357","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.add_v","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.add_v","kind":"theorem","line":356,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L356-L356","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.zero_v","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.zero_v","kind":"theorem","line":355,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L355-L355","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.instSMul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.instSMul","kind":"instance","line":352,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L352-L353","doc":"R-scalar action: coordinatewise. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.instSMulInt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.instSMulInt","kind":"instance","line":349,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L349-L350","doc":"ℤ-scalar action: coordinatewise. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.instSMulNat","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.instSMulNat","kind":"instance","line":346,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L346-L347","doc":"ℕ-scalar action: coordinatewise. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.instSub","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.instSub","kind":"instance","line":343,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L343-L344","doc":"Subtraction: coordinatewise. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.instNeg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.instNeg","kind":"instance","line":340,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L340-L341","doc":"Negation: coordinatewise. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.instAdd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.instAdd","kind":"instance","line":337,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L337-L338","doc":"Addition: coordinatewise. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.instZero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.instZero","kind":"instance","line":334,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L334-L335","doc":"Zero: the zero coordinate vector. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.v","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.v","kind":"def","line":328,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L328-L328","doc":"NF coordinates on the subscript 24-word basis (H₃ basis as prefix). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.mk","kind":"ctor","line":326,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L326-L326","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.ext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.ext","kind":"theorem","line":325,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L325-L325","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.ext_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A.ext_iff","kind":"theorem","line":325,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L325-L325","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.H4A","kind":"structure","line":323,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L323-L328","doc":"Wrapper for the H₄(q) NF module: a distinct type carrying the `mulNF₄ h`\nring structure. The parameter `h = q − q⁻¹` pins the product. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF₄_assoc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF₄_assoc","kind":"theorem","line":308,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L308-L316","doc":"**Associativity of the full H₄(q) NF product**: `(u·v)·w = u·(v·w)` —\nby right-linearity in `w` (`mulNF₄_expand_right`) and the word commutation\n`wordAction_mulNF₄`. The load-bearing algebra-object law at rank 4. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.wordAction_mulNF₄","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.wordAction_mulNF₄","kind":"theorem","line":301,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L301-L306","doc":"Word commutation `(u·v)·b_j = u·(v·b_j)` for every NF basis word — the\nfinite word induction: each of the 24 composites is a chain of the three\ngenerator commutations. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₂_mulNF₄","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₂_mulNF₄","kind":"theorem","line":294,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L294-L299","doc":"Generator commutation `(u·v)·σ₂ = u·(v·σ₂)` — the σ₂ slice of\nassociativity, proved by direct `Fin 24` computation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₁_mulNF₄","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₁_mulNF₄","kind":"theorem","line":286,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L286-L291","doc":"Generator commutation `(u·v)·σ₁ = u·(v·σ₁)` — the σ₁ slice of\nassociativity, proved by direct `Fin 24` computation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₀_mulNF₄","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₀_mulNF₄","kind":"theorem","line":278,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L278-L283","doc":"Generator commutation `(u·v)·σ₀ = u·(v·σ₀)` — the σ₀ slice of\nassociativity, proved by direct `Fin 24` computation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF₄_expand_right","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF₄_expand_right","kind":"theorem","line":259,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L259-L266","doc":"Expansion of the NF product along the right basis:\n`x · w = ∑_j w_j • (x · b_j)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF₄_e_right","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF₄_e_right","kind":"theorem","line":253,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L253-L257","doc":"**Right basis action**: `u · b_j = wordAction j u` — the 24 sparse\ngoals (the coefficient vector `e₄ j` selects exactly the `j`-th composite). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF₄_sum_right","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF₄_sum_right","kind":"theorem","line":244,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L244-L251","doc":"`mulNF₄ w ·` commutes with finite sums in the right argument. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF₄_sum_left","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF₄_sum_left","kind":"theorem","line":235,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L235-L242","doc":"`mulNF₄ · v` commutes with finite sums in the left argument. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.basis_decomp₄","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.basis_decomp₄","kind":"theorem","line":229,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L229-L233","doc":"Basis decomposition `u = ∑ᵢ uᵢ • e₄ i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.e₄","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.e₄","kind":"def","line":224,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L224-L227","doc":"The `i`-th NF basis vector `e₄ i = b_i` (subscript basis; the `₄` suffix\navoids a declaration clash with the ASCII-basis `e` of `MarkovTraceH4`,\nwhich shares this namespace). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF₄_one_left","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF₄_one_left","kind":"theorem","line":215,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L215-L220","doc":"**Left unit law**: `γ · v = v` — each basis word applied to γ reproduces\nthe corresponding NF basis element (`word_j(γ) = b_j`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF₄_one_right","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF₄_one_right","kind":"theorem","line":209,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L209-L212","doc":"**Right unit law**: `u · γ = u` (only the `v 0` term survives). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.unitNF₄","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.unitNF₄","kind":"def","line":205,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L205-L207","doc":"The unit of the NF algebra: γ = e₀ = `![1, 0, …, 0]`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF₄_zero_right","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF₄_zero_right","kind":"theorem","line":197,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L197-L201","doc":"Right zero law. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF₄_zero_left","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF₄_zero_left","kind":"theorem","line":190,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L190-L195","doc":"Left zero law. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF₄_smul_right","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF₄_smul_right","kind":"theorem","line":185,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L185-L188","doc":"`mulNF₄` is R-homogeneous in the right factor. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF₄_smul_left","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF₄_smul_left","kind":"theorem","line":177,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L177-L183","doc":"`mulNF₄` is R-homogeneous in the left factor. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF₄_add_right","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF₄_add_right","kind":"theorem","line":172,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L172-L175","doc":"`mulNF₄` is additive in the right factor. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF₄_add_left","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF₄_add_left","kind":"theorem","line":166,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L166-L170","doc":"`mulNF₄` is additive in the left factor. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₂_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₂_zero","kind":"theorem","line":160,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L160-L162","doc":"`mulσ₂` kills zero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₁_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₁_zero","kind":"theorem","line":156,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L156-L158","doc":"`mulσ₁` kills zero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₀_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₀_zero","kind":"theorem","line":152,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L152-L154","doc":"`mulσ₀` kills zero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₂_smul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₂_smul","kind":"theorem","line":147,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L147-L150","doc":"`mulσ₂` is R-homogeneous. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₁_smul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₁_smul","kind":"theorem","line":142,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L142-L145","doc":"`mulσ₁` is R-homogeneous. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₀_smul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₀_smul","kind":"theorem","line":137,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L137-L140","doc":"`mulσ₀` is R-homogeneous. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₂_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₂_add","kind":"theorem","line":132,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L132-L135","doc":"`mulσ₂` is additive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₁_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₁_add","kind":"theorem","line":127,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L127-L130","doc":"`mulσ₁` is additive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₀_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulσ₀_add","kind":"theorem","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L122-L125","doc":"`mulσ₀` is additive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.wordAction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.wordAction","kind":"def","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L91-L118","doc":"The right action of the `j`-th NF basis word, `u ↦ u · b_j` — the same\n24 composites `mulNF₄` sums over, packaged as a function so that\n`mulNF₄_e_right` and the associativity word-induction can name them. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF₄","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.H4.mulNF₄","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeH4AlgebraLaws.lean#L58-L89","doc":"The full H₄(q) NF algebra product `u · v = ∑_j v_j · (u · b_j)` on the\n**subscript** basis of `HeckeH4StabilizationRung`: `u · b_j` composes\n`mulσ₀/₁/₂` along the reduced word of `b_j`, first letter innermost\n(word `(i₀,…,i_k)` ⇒ `mulσ_{i_k} (… (mulσ_{i₀} u))`). Basis words in order:\n`γ, σ₀, σ₁, σ₁σ₀, σ₀σ₁, σ₀σ₁σ₀, σ₂, σ₁σ₂, σ₂σ₀, σ₂σ₁, σ₀σ₁σ₂, σ₁σ₀σ₂,\nσ₁σ₂σ₁, σ₂σ₀σ₁, σ₂σ₁σ₀, σ₀σ₁σ₀σ₂, σ₀σ₁σ₂σ₁, σ₁σ₀σ₂σ₁, σ₁σ₂σ₁σ₀, σ₂σ₀σ₁σ₀,\nσ₀σ₁σ₀σ₂σ₁, σ₀σ₁σ₂σ₁σ₀, σ₁σ₀σ₂σ₁σ₀, σ₀σ₁σ₀σ₂σ₁σ₀`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}